WEBVTT

43:33.060 --> 43:34.269
Woody's gone?

43:34.353 --> 43:36.312
Yeah, boy, the weasel ran away.

43:36.397 --> 43:38.481
Huh? Huh?
I told you he was guilty.

43:38.565 --> 43:42.819
Who would've thought he was
capable of such atrocities?

43:44.238 --> 43:47.115
Oh, Slink,
I hope he's okay.

43:50.077 --> 43:55.164
Oh, a survivor.
Where's the rebel base? Talk!

43:57.584 --> 44:00.128
I can see your will is strong.
